<title>USA: Omaha hogs $2.50-3.00 lower - USDA.</title>
<headline>Omaha hogs $2.50-3.00 lower - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>OMAHA 1997-06-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Barrows and gilts were $2.50-3.00</p>
<p>lower. Top $56.50 per cwt. - USDA</p>
<p>US  1-3    230-260 lbs    56.00-56.50</p>
<p>US  2-3    260-280 lbs    55.00-55.50</p>
<p>Sows: 20 percent. Weak to 0.50 lower. Top 48.00.</p>
<p>US  1-3    350-450 lbs    46.25-46.50</p>
<p>US  2-3    430-600 lbs    47.00-48.00</p>
</text>
